{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14211210","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14211210","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1421121001:1":{"text":"哇，这个蘑菇鱼汤，好香好鲜，而且很清爽！","source_cn":"哇，这个蘑菇鱼汤，好香好鲜，而且很清爽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E4C701353EA648B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421121002:1":{"text":"哈哈，这可是我们小时候最喜欢吃的东西，那会儿我们都是小孩子，吃的可没现在这么好。","source_cn":"哈哈，这可是我们小时候最喜欢吃的东西，那会儿我们都是小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB9BD3C9C995EDD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421121003:1":{"text":"比如蘑菇鱼汤，因为茸茸伞菇容易有毒，我们不敢放很多，只能放几朵，调个味道而已。","source_cn":"比如蘑菇鱼汤，因为茸茸伞菇容易有毒，我们不敢放很多，只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9C09262047D9F5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421121004:1":{"text":"所以，芬洛先生，你和因度厄大人小时候也要经常到野外去和野兽抢食吗？","source_cn":"所以，芬洛先生，你和因度厄大人小时候也要经常到野外去和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x393B5CA2E4ABB6B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421121005:1":{"text":"没错，不止我们俩，当时有不少孤儿，只不过带头的是我们两个——话是这么说，我是沾了因度厄的光。","source_cn":"没错，不止我们俩，当时有不少孤儿，只不过带头的是我们两...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43CB761F3605B74D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421121006:1":{"text":"那家伙从小就很机敏，身手也好，不仅每次都能满载而归，很快还学会了打猎！","source_cn":"那家伙从小就很机敏，身手也好，不仅每次都能满载而归，很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22769686FCE7BA16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421121007:1":{"text":"原来他的弓箭和体能是在野外从小磨练出来的啊……真是了不起。","source_cn":"原来他的弓箭和体能是在野外从小磨练出来的啊……真是了不起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CAFAE3D368DFD0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421121008:1":{"text":"当然啦，我们也不会闲着，大家弄到食物以后都会汇集到我这，我就做成菜。","source_cn":"当然啦，我们也不会闲着，大家弄到食物以后都会汇集到我这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x616DD53068F75E34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421121009:1":{"text":"我的手艺可不一般！毕竟我们那会儿经常饥一顿饱一顿，能用的食材很有限。","source_cn":"我的手艺可不一般！毕竟我们那会儿经常饥一顿饱一顿，能用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5944D13061D5351E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421121010:1":{"text":"那，芬洛先生，因度厄大人他小时候还有什么出名的事迹吗？","source_cn":"那，芬洛先生，因度厄大人他小时候还有什么出名的事迹吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x127BBC4775DFC3B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fem